<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
html { background: #ffffff; }
body {
  width: 720pt; height: 405pt; margin: 0; padding: 0;
  background: #F4F6F6;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  display: flex;
}
.header {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  height: 70pt;
  background: #1C2833;
  padding: 20pt 40pt;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.header h1 {
  font-size: 30pt;
  color: #F4F6F6;
  margin: 0;
}
.content {
  position: absolute;
  top: 70pt; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
  padding: 20pt 40pt 40pt 40pt;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.strategy-title {
  font-size: 20pt;
  color: #1C2833;
  margin: 0 0 20pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
  text-align: center;
}
.layout {
  display: flex;
  gap: 25pt;
  height: 250pt;
}
.column {
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.chart-area {
  flex: 1;
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 10pt;
  padding: 15pt;
  box-shadow: 0 2pt 8pt rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}
.chart-area h2 {
  font-size: 16pt;
  color: #D4AF37;
  margin: 0 0 10pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
.bullets {
  margin-top: 15pt;
}
.bullets ul {
  margin: 0;
  padding-left: 20pt;
  font-size: 13pt;
  color: #2E4053;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
  <h1>核心策略：哑铃型配置，攻守兼备</h1>
</div>
<div class="content">
  <p class="strategy-title">2025年投资主线：一手抓硬科技成长，一手抓高红利防守</p>
  <div class="layout">
    <div class="column">
      <div class="chart-area" id="chart1" class="placeholder" style="width: 100%; height: 100%;"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="column">
      <div class="chart-area" id="chart2" class="placeholder" style="width: 100%; height: 100%;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
